      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "水煤气制备过程会发生如下两个反应:"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "$$\\begin{array}{ll} \\mathrm{C(s)+H_2O(g)\\rightarrow H_2(g)+CO(g)} & K_{\\mathrm{I}}^{\\ominus} \\\\ \\mathrm{CO(g)+H_2O(g)\\rightarrow H_2(g)+CO_2(g)} & K_{\\mathrm{II}}^{\\ominus} \\end{array}$$"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "已知所涉及物质在298 K时的热力学数据如下表:"
    },
    {
      "type": "callout",
      "tone": "info",
      "text": "(原卷此处含表格/仪器试剂表,详见 PDF 或 MD 源文件。)"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "请作适当的近似处理,回答以下问题。"
    }
  ],
  "parts": [
    {
      "id": "part-000127-01",
      "label": "6-1",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "求算以上两个反应在 1300 K 时的平衡常数 $K_{\\mathrm{I}}^{\\ominus}$ 和 $K_{\\mathrm{II}}^{\\ominus}$。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "part-000127-02",
      "label": "6-2",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "设 $1\\ \\mathrm{mol\\ H_2O}$ 与过量的 C(s) 在 1300 K、100 kPa 条件下反应达到平衡,求各气体物质的摩尔分数(若 6-1 问没能求算出结果,可取 $K_{\\mathrm{I}}^{\\ominus}=50$,$K_{\\mathrm{II}}^{\\ominus}=0.20$)。"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
